# Optional Polars engine. All native owners are private and uniquely released.
# Views are borrowed for one call. Native allocation failure can abort the process.
opaque RawStrings
opaque RawError
opaque RawColumn
opaque RawFrame
opaque RawExpr
opaque RawExprs
opaque RawQuery
opaque RawSortKeys
opaque RawCsvSchema

